# Soap bubbles: infinitely thin films whose colour comes from interference.
# Dark horizon, bright zenith: the bubbles reflect the bright sky and glow against the dark.
sky 0.06 2.5
camera 0 1.5 6  0 1 0  38
image 640 360 128
floor 8 0.5 0.05
sphere 0 1.2 0 1.2 thinfilm 1.33 280
sphere 2.6 0.7 0.8 0.7 thinfilm 1.33 450
sphere -2.4 0.6 1.0 0.6 thinfilm 1.33 180